=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {n:Emhi Tchaoryo}.
* Travel to the Beastman Ensign at (I-8) (Map 1, NW corner of I-8, bordering H-8) in {z:Fort Karugo-Narugo (S)}.
* Once the party leader has selected to enter, you will be transported into {z:Ghoyu's Reverie}.
** You cannot summon {p:Trusts|Trust} inside.
* Two groups of three Yagudo (six total) will **immediately** start slowly running towards their designated ends.
** {m:Yagudo Carrier} - occasionally runs away while fighting.
** {m:Yagudo Guard} x2 - Links with the {m:Yagudo Carrier}, but does not run.
** Should the {m:Yagudo Carrier} make it to the end of the area (which is smaller than the area in {p:Pit Spider I (W)}) the mission is failed.
* Once all six Yagudo are defeated, the objective is complete.
** **Exit at the Twilight Aureole to complete the mission.** Do not warp out!
* Return to {n:Emhi Tchaoryo} to receive the Op rewards.

=2 Notes
* If you run north immediately upon entering, you can catch and aggro both groups at the same time.
* The Yagudo are very weak and susceptible to {s:Sleep} and {s:Gravity}.
** They have approximately 2,500 HP each.

